{"unit_id":"exoticknight__dsh-labnana#card-zh","repo":"exoticknight/dsh-labnana","commit":"d21eeb810b180a85f36c53f414e67ae396002482","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-labnana（DSH 插件，网页客户端）：把 Labnana 图片生成接入 DSH 对话，用户可通过模型工具生成或编辑图片。它注册图片生成、积分估算、订阅余额和异步任务查询工具，并在网页设置页提供密钥、模型、尺寸、比例和保存选项。主要功能包括文生图、参考图驱动的图生图与编辑、生成前估算积分，以及在对话卡片查看并保存图片。适合需要在 DSH 项目中生成视觉素材或修改参考图的用户。使用前需要 Labnana API Key；图片请求发送至 Labnana 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/index.ts:774-1003","src/client/index.tsx:769-896"]}
{"unit_id":"exoticknight__dsh-labnana#card-en","repo":"exoticknight/dsh-labnana","commit":"d21eeb810b180a85f36c53f414e67ae396002482","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-labnana adds Labnana image generation to DSH web chats. Tools create or edit images from prompts and references, estimate credits, check balances, and query tasks. Results appear in chat and can be saved to the project. A Labnana API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/index.ts:774-1003","src/client/index.tsx:769-896"]}
