{"unit_id":"exoticknight__dsh-labnana#feature-generate","repo":"exoticknight/dsh-labnana","commit":"d21eeb810b180a85f36c53f414e67ae396002482","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-labnana 的功能「文生图与图像编辑」：可以用文字提示生成图片，也可提交 URL、本地文件或 base64 参考图进行图生图和编辑。通过模型调用生成工具，支持多种模型、尺寸和比例，结果显示在对话图片卡片中。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/index.ts:774-881"]}
{"unit_id":"exoticknight__dsh-labnana#feature-credits","repo":"exoticknight/dsh-labnana","commit":"d21eeb810b180a85f36c53f414e67ae396002482","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-labnana 的功能「积分估算」：生成前可提交提示词、模型、尺寸、比例和可选参考图，查询预计积分及是否可生成；调用积分估算工具即可获得结果，不会执行图片生成。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/index.ts:882-941"]}
{"unit_id":"exoticknight__dsh-labnana#feature-account","repo":"exoticknight/dsh-labnana","commit":"d21eeb810b180a85f36c53f414e67ae396002482","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-labnana 的功能「订阅与余额」：可查询 Labnana 账户的可用积分、免费额度、套餐和到期信息。模型调用订阅查询工具后，会得到账户摘要，便于判断当前额度是否足够。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/index.ts:942-997"]}
{"unit_id":"exoticknight__dsh-labnana#feature-tasks","repo":"exoticknight/dsh-labnana","commit":"d21eeb810b180a85f36c53f414e67ae396002482","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-labnana 的功能「异步任务查询」：4K 或异步生成会返回任务标识；可用任务查询工具查看任务状态、图片地址或失败信息，生成等待超时后也可继续查询。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/index.ts:998-1050"]}
{"unit_id":"exoticknight__dsh-labnana#caveat-credentials","repo":"exoticknight/dsh-labnana","commit":"d21eeb810b180a85f36c53f414e67ae396002482","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-labnana 使用前须知：需配置 Labnana API Key；提示词及生成或参考图片随请求发送到 api.labnana.com。图片默认仅留在进程内存，启用保存或手动保存时才写入项目目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/index.ts:114-126","src/host/index.ts:170-183","src/host/index.ts:293-300"]}
